        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Together is a multiplayer drawing game where creativity meets chaos. Gather people online and experience the hilarious results of collaborative art creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your drawings evolve (or devolve) as they pass from player to player, creating amusing misinterpretations and unexpected results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artistic skills required! Even with zero drawing ability, your effort and enthusiasm will lead to fantastic results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable lobby settings to tailor the experience to your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive controls that anyone can pick up within seconds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorite creations - preserve the most hilarious moments for posterity!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're already skilled with a pencil or completely new to drawing, Art Together offers a fun way to practice your skills. Who knows? This game might even spark your passion for the visual arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your mouse or drawing tablet and prepare for an art experience where the journey is far more important than the destination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Together is a multiplayer drawing game where creativity meets chaos. Gather people online and experience the hilarious results of collaborative art creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your drawings evolve (or devolve) as they pass from player to player, creating amusing misinterpretations and unexpected results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artistic skills required! Even with zero drawing ability, your effort and enthusiasm will lead to fantastic results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable lobby settings to tailor the experience to your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive controls that anyone can pick up within seconds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorite creations - preserve the most hilarious moments for posterity!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're already skilled with a pencil or completely new to drawing, Art Together offers a fun way to practice your skills. Who knows? This game might even spark your passion for the visual arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your mouse or drawing tablet and prepare for an art experience where the journey is far more important than the destination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
